 "section_summary": "This section comprises a State Department transmittal despatch and the major portion of a General Headquarters, Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers (GHQ SCAP) Civil Information and Education Section special report on educational institutions in Kagawa Prefecture, Japan, for April and November 1946. The report provides background context on pre-reform Japanese school administration, statistical summary tables analyzing institutions, student enrollment, and faculty across administrative levels, and an exhaustive roster of individual schools. The roster entries in this section detail national, prefectural, and municipal institutions, as well as village and town secondary schools and elementary schools through the town of Ikeda.",
