   "start_page": 2,
   "summary": "This special report compiles statistical data and rosters of all recognized educational institutions in Kagawa Prefecture across national, prefectural, municipal, and village or town jurisdictions as of April and November 1946. It includes an analytical introduction explaining pre-reform Japanese school categories, summary numerical and percentage tables on enrollment and teaching staff, and detailed institutional listings recording foundation dates, student enrollment by sex, and faculty counts. This section covers higher and secondary schools, special institutions, and municipal and village or town elementary schools up through Ikeda Daisan Elementary School.",
   "title": "Roster and Statistics of Japanese Educational Institutions, April and November 1946, Part 17: Kagawa Prefecture (Special Report AR-302-E-A-26-17)",
